# Approved third-party Go modules and their licences (ADR D-2, D-24, checklist 00).
#
# Format: <module path> <SPDX licence> [note]
#
# A dependency may only be added by adding a line here, after checking its licence is
# compatible with AGPL-3.0 and that the dependency is worth its audit cost.
# `scripts/guards.sh licenses` fails if a module in the build is not listed, or is
# listed with a licence outside the allowed set.

github.com/tink-crypto/tink-go/v2 Apache-2.0 streaming AEAD, the primitive Tryst writes (D-13)
golang.org/x/crypto BSD-3-Clause PBKDF2 and Argon2id
golang.org/x/sys BSD-3-Clause indirect, via x/crypto
google.golang.org/protobuf BSD-3-Clause indirect, via tink-go
modernc.org/sqlite BSD-3-Clause pure-Go SQLite, no cgo (D-13); bundles SQLite itself (public domain)
modernc.org/libc BSD-3-Clause indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite
modernc.org/mathutil BSD-3-Clause indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite
modernc.org/memory BSD-3-Clause indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite
github.com/dustin/go-humanize MIT indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite
github.com/google/uuid BSD-3-Clause indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite (Linux build only)
github.com/mattn/go-isatty MIT indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite
github.com/ncruces/go-strftime MIT indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite
github.com/remyoudompheng/bigfft BSD-3-Clause indirect, via modernc.org/sqlite
